#==============================================================================================
#
#   selector_parsing_3 - parsing selectors: pseudo-elements and simple selectors
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/SelectorParsing.cpp (lines 872-1185): `::pseudo-element`,
#       `::pseudo-element(arguments)` and the legacy single-colon forms, unknown `-webkit-`
#       pseudo-elements, and <simple-selector> (type, universal, class, id, attribute,
#       pseudo-class, pseudo-element and nesting selectors).
